Name: Treetop Tattoo Clarity
Author: Kitty
# TN_TattooParlor - NestPatcher mod (TiTS 0.9.167), v2.6
# Treetop Tattoo (Catalina's shop on Tavros):
#  - Every button has a tooltip that says what it does, what it costs, and why it is greyed out.
#  - "Tattoo" and "Removal" are renamed "Get Tattoo" and "Remove Ink"; "Proceed" is "Pick Spot".
#  - The pubic spot no longer shows up as a second "Belly" button without a vagina (now "Pubic Area").
#  - 30 new tattoo spots on top of the game's 13 (43 total):
#      Shoulder, Right/Left Upper Arm, Right/Left Lower Arm, Right/Left Wrist, Arm Sleeves (both), Right/Left Arm Sleeve, Right/Left Palm, Ribs, Upper Back, Lower Back,
#      Right/Left Thigh, Right/Left Knee, Right/Left Calf, Right/Left Ankle, Right/Left Foot,
#      Wings, Tail, Flank (taurs), Cock, Balls.
#    The game's Arm spot is relabelled Middle Arm (a ring around the elbow). The game's own Hand, Back, Thigh, Leg and Foot spots stay, so each side can have its own design.
#    Spots your body does not have are greyed out with the reason.
#  - Spot and removal lists show 12 per page with Prev Page / Next Page buttons (Done/Back on every page).
#  - Feathered spots can't be inked, matching Catalina's intro (her nanobots only color skin, fur and scales):
#    feathered body, arms, legs, tail, wings or balls block the matching spots. Avian legs are scaled below
#    the knee, so Leg, calves, ankles and feet stay open for them. Palms and cock are never feathered.
#  - Appearance: the main Appearance text gets a Tattoos paragraph; the Tattoos tab lists the new spots.
#  - Fixes "New Ink" after a removal needing more than 1000 credits instead of 1000.
# Saves: new spots are saved with the character. Without the mod, the game ignores them.
# Targets: main.js, content_tavros.js (Android main.d3448d52.js and the PC build).
# Needs NestPatcher 1.4 / Android 1.3 or newer: @@name@@ stands for a minified function name,
# which is different in the PC and Android builds.

